  initialDialog:
  - "Umm... Mister Bunny? Have you seen a blue hat? It's soft\u2026 and it smells
    like sunshine."
  - "I wore it every day. But now... it\u2019s gone.\n\nsniff"
  acceptOption: I can help you find it.
  acceptAnswer: "R-really? You\u2019ll help? Thank you\u2026 I was trying not to
    cry, but my eyes keep leaking."
  declineOption: "I can\u2019t help right now."
  declineAnswer: "Oh\u2026 okay. I\u2019ll keep looking\u2026 even if my legs get
    tired."
  comebackAfterDecline: "You came back\u2026 d-do you think you can help now? I\u2019m
    scared my hat is getting lonely."
  comebackInProgress: "Did you see it anywhere? I\u2026 I keep hoping it\u2019s hiding,
    not lost."
  comebackCompleted: "That\u2019s it! That\u2019s my hat! You found it!\r\nIt really
    did miss me\u2026"
  finalWords: "I\u2019m keeping my hat close this time. But\u2026 you can come say
    hi whenever."
